{"ID":"20240118151111-37p3bls","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151111-37p3bls","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151111-37p3bls\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151111-nctth2s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135313-lx9si1r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135313-lx9si1r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:131,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:131\u0026#125;","title":"218龙眼","type":"doc","updated":"20240201172930"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151111-nctth2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151111-nctth2s","updated":"20240122134236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，平，无毒。治五脏邪气，安志，厌食。久服强魂魄，聪明，轻身，不老，通神明。生南海山谷。一名益智。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135238-dtuv6sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135238-dtuv6sx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国福建四川广东等地，实形圆，故名。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135243-mgg5c9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135243-mgg5c9q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135244-ul69pps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135244-ul69pps","updated":"20240201172858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】龙眼为滋养要药，主益脾长肌，养心安神，治血虚怔忡劳神健忘。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135245-g2tg3ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135245-g2tg3ed"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主五脏邪气，安志厌食，除蛊毒，去三虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135247-2ebq1b5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135247-2ebq1b5","updated":"20240201172859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【括要】主补血气，养肌肉，益虚气，除健忘，治怔忡，开胃益脾，补虚长智。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135248-6zuz0s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135248-6zuz0s5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135249-egximqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135249-egximqp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】甘能作胀，凡中满气膈之证均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135250-u5ti8ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135250-u5ti8ql"}},{"ID":"20240122135250-h7ow6ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135250-h7ow6ke"}},{"ID":"20240122135250-qp0ji4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135250-qp0ji4s","updated":"20240201172506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"218是龙眼，像龙眼呀，山茱萸呀，都是滋阴的药，滋润滋养的药。市面上的归脾汤里面都有龙眼，它能够补血。你不要拿那个龙眼树的龙眼，我们用那个龙眼干。味甘平。很好吃，平时可以泡龙眼茶喝。"}]},{"ID":"20240122135302-blwsaat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135302-blwsaat","updated":"20240201172615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那龙眼是滋养的药，它主要可以益脾长肌肉。为什么？甘味入脾，能够健脾，脾统血，身上的血是脾脏在管，入脾的都能够补到血。可以养心安神，所以治血虚怔忡劳神健忘。你如果用龙眼红糖生姜熬给你太太吃，太太就很开心呀，月经来了不会吵你啊，因为她不痛了，心情也会很好，因为它可以安神。那老师我们再加点蜜蜂蜂胶进去。"}]},{"ID":"20240122135303-r2g619h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135303-r2g619h","updated":"20240201172835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最近那个研究蜂蜜可以延年益寿也去拿个诺贝尔奖。他们现在已经没有东西可以研究了，已经到极限了西医。研究一个蜂胶说可以让人延年益寿都可以拿诺贝尔奖？这个蜂胶我们介绍过，这是蜂蜡，蜂蜡是蜜蜂筑巢用的，我们叫露蜂房。他们说这个蜂蜡可以养颜拿诺贝尔奖，你看看，烂到这种程度。（笑）因为他没有东西可以研究了嘛！中医不是没有东西，真正好的理论是圆形的，是没有极限的一直在循环，当你越了解的时候，越简单越简单越简化。西医不是，西医是一条线，二分法，越分越细，越分越细，到后来没有东西可以分啦。到时就完了，所以它现在就结束了嘛。下次你去写说龙眼也可以延年益寿，也去拿诺贝尔奖。（大笑而有余音回旋）这个龙眼又很好吃，冬天也可以喝个龙眼茶，你什么时候听说别人吃龙眼死掉的。所以说你不要去想它有没有负作用，一想就知道了嘛！"}]},{"ID":"20240122135313-lx9si1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135313-lx9si1r","updated":"20240201172930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龙眼能够养心安神，所以太太小姐们比较虚弱，面色比较差的，气血虚的都可以吃龙眼，能够治血虚、怔忡。你看【括要】说补血气，养肌肉，益虚气，开胃益脾都很好用。剂量都无所谓了，可以当食物，2钱3钱呀，看你自己加进去，煮完汤药你可以把龙眼挑出来吃，龙眼肉很好吃嘛。"}]}]}